MODULE: SupersedingCopyPreservedClearanceIgnoresAlias
TARGET: SupersedingCopyPreserved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: resize undo clears compensation against an unrelated later serving copy
PERTURBS: UndoClearance

--- FIND
    /\ running /\ undo = "checking" /\ ~replicated /\ alias = "new"
--- REPLACE
    /\ running /\ undo = "checking" /\ ~replicated
--- END
